1
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:19,556
On compte les marches ? Un, deux, trois.
Shall we count the steps? One, two, three.

2
00:00:19,656 --> 00:00:24,740
Oui ! Quatre, cinq, six.
Yes! Four, five, six.

3
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:28,316
Sept, huit, neuf...
Seven, eight, nine...

4
00:00:28,416 --> 00:00:33,212
Et dix ! Voilà, dix marches.
And ten! There we go, ten steps.

5
00:00:33,312 --> 00:00:36,452
C'était facile, non ?
That was easy, wasn't it?

6
00:00:36,552 --> 00:00:39,836
Oui, comptons encore !
Yes, let's count again!

7
00:00:39,936 --> 00:00:42,908
Un, deux, trois !
One, two, three!

8
00:00:43,008 --> 00:00:46,100
Merci, Adrien !
Thank you, Adrien!
